      "created_at": "2015-03-13T16:19:28.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi, im pretty new to sentinels of the multiverse and my group of friends have been really getting into it lately. I wanted to know if we have multiple of the same hero ,guise for example since I know he doesnt have a difrent promo hero card, could we have 2 or more guise's ? Or can you only have multiples of heros with diffrent hero cards like promo-card wraith and normal wraith ? Or just no multiples at all. I wanted to know the rules for things like that.<br><br>Thank you for your time to anyone who responds.</p>",
